cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Critic Architecture Matters: Dual vs. Unified Critics for Humanoid Loco-Manipulation"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of a controlled comparison between dual and unified critic
  architectures for multi-objective humanoid loco-manipulation. Policies are trained on
  the Unitree G1 in NVIDIA Isaac Lab through a 13-level sequential curriculum spanning
  stationary reaching to walking with variable-orientation targets.
